            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.86</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>FLUX Video Edit generates.</b> It asked for a start image that it never offers. The model edits an existing clip, so a source video and a prompt are all it needs. Switching to it now also clears reference images or audio from the previous model, which it cannot take.</li>
<li><b>A disabled Generate button says why.</b> The reason used to live in the tooltip alone, so a blocked generate showed a price and nothing else. It now stands under the button in the video, image and audio composers.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
